# PicoERP

Vanilla JS offline-first ERP. Layers: **UI → Services → Engine → Repository → IndexedDB**.

Before large changes, read root `AGENTS.md` and the `AGENTS.md` in the target folder.

- App name: PicoERP. DB: `erpDataStore`.
- Routes in `js/routes.js`; nav in `js/ui/layout.js`.
- Bump `APP_VERSION`, `index.html` script `?v=`, and `sw.js` `CACHE_VERSION` when users need a cache bust.
- Keep UI free of direct IndexedDB access.
- Prefer extending book templates / User Guide over ad-hoc one-off UX.
